90 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 18 0 R
/E (Reconstructing 3D scenes typically requires depth sensors, calibrated cameras, or dedicated capture setups. We show that a single video from a consumer phone is enough. Our pipeline combines a frozen monocular depth model and a long-range point tracker with classical geometric optimisation, producing metric-scale textured meshes without any per-scene training.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [72]
>>
endobj
